Changes: the C++ and Python tools were rewritten in Python (numpy, numba, PyVista); rays entering the grid through
a positive face are no longer dropped; drone velocity is computed; grid publishing is rate-limited; and camera
calibration, lens undistortion, macOS capture, video replay, camera agreement and a noise filter were added.
